  "body": "## What changed\n\n`crates/app/tests/lead_approach.rs` has a helper, `beside_the_cut_part`. It now asserts that the stock-source pocket on `Milling-test.step` has no `Gouge`. Before this change, it asserted that the pocket has one.\n\n## Why\n\nTwo tests fail on main (b6c02115):\n\n- `the_reported_keep_down_helix_pocket_enters_every_level_once`\n- `the_horizontal_arc_entry_on_the_users_pocket_verifies_silent`\n\nCommit 086f4010 (#1603) wrote the old assertion. At that time the stock-source pocket cut through the part. PR #1656 (#1554) changed the pocket: it now clears the stock around the part. So the pocket stays off the part, and the old assertion fails. The new behaviour is correct, and the test now pins it.\n\n## How tested\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test lead_approach`: 6 passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --tests --no-deps -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe change is test-only. Product code does not change.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1675\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\n",
